188
00:09:56.679 --> 00:09:59.341
Promise me you won't tell anyone
until after he proposes.

189
00:09:59.415 --> 00:10:02.248
Oh, God. I would never.
I'd be out of my mind.

190
00:10:06.823 --> 00:10:09.519
