191
00:10:11.394 --> 00:10:13.988
- Can we get four tequila shots?
- No. No.

192
00:10:14.063 --> 00:10:16.463
No, no, no. None for me.

193
00:10:16.533 --> 00:10:18.467
- Oh, right.
- I'm fine.

194
00:10:18.535 --> 00:10:21.971
Acapulco, 2006-
Emma and Fletcher on a break.

195
00:10:22.038 --> 00:10:24.029
"Never talk about that weekend again. "

196
