Okay, okay, okay.
Make it stop. Please.

198
00:10:30.914 --> 00:10:32.905
<i>All right, a toast.</i>

199
00:10:32.982 --> 00:10:35.746
To Liv-
Congratulations to an amazing friend.

200
00:10:35.819 --> 00:10:38.549
