- Nate! I'm getting married.

205
00:10:50.233 --> 00:10:51.894
- Get out.
- Yeah.

206
00:10:51.968 --> 00:10:53.902
Oh, my God. Sister's gettin' married here.

207
00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:57.701
<i>- Where's-Where's the groom?
- Oh. Oh. He's not here.</i>

208
00:10:57.774 --> 00:11:00.402
Well, he hasn't actually
popped the question yet.

209
00:11:01.411 --> 00:11:03.106
A toast-To Daniel...

210
00:11:03.179 --> 00:11:05.739
<i>who in his own world
is just working late...</i>

211
00:11:05.815 --> 00:11:07.749
but I guess in Liv's world
has just proposed.

212
00:11:07.817 --> 00:11:09.751
So God bless him for wanting...

213
00:11:09.819 --> 00:11:12.185
to spend his life
with my sister in any world.

214
00:11:12.255 --> 00:11:14.815
- To Liv.
- We love ya.

215
00:11:16.492 --> 00:11:20.258
<i>- He's a lucky guy.
- Yep. The biggest day of a girl's life.</i>

216
00:11:22.265 --> 00:11:24.563
I'm gonna be right back.

217
00:11:31.474 --> 00:11:34.602
- Damn. Should I?
- I got it.

218
00:11:48.524 --> 00:11:52.927
I mean, they didn't get
to see me graduate law school...

219
00:11:52.996 --> 00:11:56.363
<i>or read Nate's first story
in New York magazine.</i>

220
00:11:57.867 --> 00:12:00.131
So I can't share this with 'em.

221
00:12:03.206 --> 00:12:05.401
