Fine's not really a feeling though.

1153
01:04:44.197 --> 01:04:46.893
Fine's a feeling.

1154
01:04:46.966 --> 01:04:48.991
"I feel fine. " You could say that.
People say that.

1155
01:04:49.069 --> 01:04:51.367
Yeah, sure. You can say that.

1156
01:04:52.539 --> 01:04:55.372
Okay. It's, like-

1157
01:04:55.442 --> 01:04:57.603
