- Yeah. Are you happy?

1300
01:14:16.902 --> 01:14:18.893
Uh-

1301
01:14:18.971 --> 01:14:21.940
<i>When I get
visual confirmation on bride one walking...</i>

1302
01:14:22.008 --> 01:14:23.976
give video a five count and roll.

1303
01:14:24.043 --> 01:14:27.137
<i>And ready.</i>

1304
01:14:28.781 --> 01:14:30.715
<i>Walk.</i>

1305
01:14:48.067 --> 01:14:51.833
<i>I'm in Acapulco, babyI Spring breakI</i>

1306
01:14:51.904 --> 01:14:56.432
I'm here with Miguel.

1307
01:14:58.911 --> 01:15:01.277
<i>I love spring breakI
I want to danceI</i>

1308
01:15:01.347 --> 01:15:05.113
<i>Go, EmmaI Go, EmmaI</i>

1309
01:15:07.987 --> 01:15:10.615
<i>- I love being EmmaI
- I-</i>

1310
01:15:25.538 --> 01:15:27.472
We've been hit.
Repeat, we've been hit.

1311
01:15:43.489 --> 01:15:46.390
<i>EmmaI</i>

1312
01:15:46.459 --> 01:15:48.586
<i>Let me tell you something about that tapeI</i>

1313
01:15:48.661 --> 01:15:54.622
God, you swore! You swore
you'd never show that to anyone.

1314
01:15:55.901 --> 01:15:58.836
Just... let them go.

1315
01:15:58.904 --> 01:15:59.996
Emma!

1316
01:16:00.072 --> 01:16:02.438
Bring it on!

1317
01:16:02.508 --> 01:16:05.909
<i>EmmaI I don't want to fightI</i>

1318
01:16:05.978 --> 01:16:10.108
- Let me just tell you something!
- I don't want to fight!

1319
01:16:11.217 --> 01:16:14.186
It's over. I can't do this anymore.

1320
01:16:15.855 --> 01:16:18.790
<i>I can't do this anymore.</i>

1321
01:16:29.335 --> 01:16:31.860
Thank God.

1322
01:17:17.750 --> 01:17:20.344
I'm fine.

1323
01:17:22.421 --> 01:17:25.185
Emma, what the hell
are you doing? Have you lost your mind?

1324
01:17:25.257 --> 01:17:27.350
