and tell me the truth.

1330
01:17:44.610 --> 01:17:47.511
You're in love with a girl
that you met 10 years ago.

1331
01:17:47.580 --> 01:17:50.947
Hey, what's the matter with that? Huh?

1332
01:17:51.016 --> 01:17:54.349
