1339
01:18:48.340 --> 01:18:50.274
Good-bye.

1340
01:18:53.646 --> 01:18:56.444
Oh, my God. Emma.

1341
01:19:03.722 --> 01:19:06.748
I'm fine.

1342
01:19:06.825 --> 01:19:09.589
This is all my fault.
That video was never supposed to happen.

1343
01:19:09.662 --> 01:19:13.257
<i>I mean, it was supposed to
happen, but I canceled it. I thought I did.</i>

1344
01:19:13.332 --> 01:19:16.460
