1352
01:19:53.372 --> 01:19:55.465
Are you crying?

1353
01:19:55.541 --> 01:19:57.634
Yeah. It's like a whole new me.

1354
01:19:57.710 --> 01:20:01.305
And I just- I cry all the time.

1355
01:20:01.380 --> 01:20:05.976
- I'm kind of a basket case.
- No, Liv, I didn't want that. I'm sorry.

1356
01:20:06.051 --> 01:20:08.713
No. No, you were right.

1357
01:20:08.787 --> 01:20:12.086
I don't have to have it
constantly together all the time.

1358
01:20:13.158 --> 01:20:17.595
It's like... this huge wake-up call.

1359
01:20:17.663 --> 01:20:20.791
And I'm kind of stumbling around
a little bit, but...

1360
01:20:22.001 --> 01:20:24.060
